      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TANDANYA (2) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 1.3 lengths win at Sale in a handy 24.64. Fair draw can see a good run and goes well at this distance. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. One of the key runners again. RIVERS MEET (7) doesn't win out of turn. Finished in the money last time though when second (26.05) at this track. Form at the trip sound including five wins. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Hard to beat again. PAW GREGSON (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.41) in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ROCKY SUPERSTAR (3) is looking to continue his winning ways off a fast 22.62 victory latest. One of the chances.",
